      "y": 384,
      "width": 532,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 19,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 31.349999999999998,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA 从一个简单的落差开始：我们对 AI 说得越来越多，却仍然",
        "很难重新回到自己的表达。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-1db97a7b9d37",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
