      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 16,
      "letter_spacing": 2.4,
      "color": "#707975",
      "lines": [
        "01 / A DESIGN PRINCIPLE"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-c22e6fac9b28",
      "role": "decorative-annotation",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-zh-1440.020",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x": 76,
      "y": 816,
      "width": 556,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 47,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 52,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "不是更多维护，",
        "而是更好地继续。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-a47ac8d57fde",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-zh-1440.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 76,
      "y": 950,
      "width": 492,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "我们围绕你已经产生的表达，构建个人输入、思想与上下文系统",
        "。在你还没有整理任何主题之前，档案就应该有用。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-f2e6662a63c0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
