      "lines": [
        "02 / A DESIGN PRINCIPLE"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-053adbd47d12",
      "role": "decorative-annotation",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-zh-1440.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 788,
      "y": 1348,
      "width": 556,
      "font_family": "Noto Serif CJK SC",
      "font_size": 47,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 52,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "先属于你，",
        "再对其他系统有用。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-52d672623d1c",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "our-story-zh-1440.026",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x": 788,
      "y": 1482,
      "width": 492,
      "font_family": "Noto Sans CJK SC",
      "font_size": 17,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 28.049999999999997,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "为人可读与为 AI 可用，并不互相排斥。可核对的来源、可编辑的",
        "工作版本和可控制的选择，是两者共同的基础。"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-447afaaa2e9a",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
